{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The existing refund handler is literally a stub, while the platform already exposes order totals, status history, transactions, and product availability services. I’m adding a persisted return aggregate and wiring one transactional operation so validation happens before any stock, order, payment, or history mutation."}}
